         appsettings.json, so "does saving preserve everything it did not mean to change" needs to be
         a test rather than a hope. WPF itself is never constructed by these tests. -->
    <ProjectReference Include="..\..\src\MinecraftFirewall.App\MinecraftFirewall.App.csproj" />
  </ItemGroup>

</Project>